  $E>\SI{100}{\tera\eV}$ as predicted from data by the Pierre Auger 
  observatory. The average mass increases with energy. 4-component Gaussian fit
  from \cite{martinsEmpiricalDescriptionComposition2023}. \subref{fig:dipole} 
